  "description": "☕🍂 Celebrate the cozy flavors of fall with this modern autumn drinks watercolor clipart collection featuring handcrafted coffee creations, seasonal teas, warm ciders, creamy lattes, and comforting café favorites. Painted in a soft contemporary watercolor style with organic shapes, warm earthy tones, and minimal seasonal accents, each illustration captures the inviting atmosphere of crisp autumn mornings and cozy coffee shop moments.\n✨ Perfect for:\n• Print on Demand products\n• Stickers and sticker sheets\n• Journals and planners\n• Scrapbooking projects\n• Seasonal stationery\n• Greeting cards and invitations\n• Café branding and menus\n• Digital planners\n• Printable crafts\n• Cricut and Silhouette projects\n🍁 What’s included:\n• 15 high-quality watercolor illustrations\n• Transparent background\n• High resolution\n• 15 PNG files (transparent background)\n• 15 SVG files\n🎃 Included illustrations:\nPumpkin spice latte, hot apple cider, maple cinnamon latte, chai tea latte, salted caramel hot chocolate, honey lavender latte, orange spiced tea, cranberry mulled cider, vanilla bean cappuccino, toasted marshmallow mocha, pear & cinnamon tea, pumpkin cream cold brew, brown sugar oat latte, blackberry herbal tea, gingerbread latte.\n🤎 Designed in a modern cozy watercolor style, these autumn drinks feature handcrafted mugs, elegant glassware, creamy foams, warm spices, and subtle seasonal accents without overwhelming details. Their soft organic shapes and inviting color palette make them perfect for autumn stickers, stationery, planners, mugs, kitchen décor, seasonal branding, and cozy fall-inspired creative projects.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>☕🍂 Celebrate the cozy flavors of fall with this modern autumn drinks watercolor clipart collection featuring handcrafted coffee creations, seasonal teas, warm ciders, creamy lattes, and comforting café favorites. Painted in a soft contemporary watercolor style with organic shapes, warm earthy tones, and minimal seasonal accents, each illustration captures the inviting atmosphere of crisp autumn mornings and cozy coffee shop moments.</p>\n<p>✨ Perfect for:<br>\n• Print on Demand products<br>\n• Stickers and sticker sheets<br>\n• Journals and planners<br>\n• Scrapbooking projects<br>\n• Seasonal stationery<br>\n• Greeting cards and invitations<br>\n• Café branding and menus<br>\n• Digital planners<br>\n• Printable crafts<br>\n• Cricut and Silhouette projects</p>\n<p>🍁 What’s included:<br>\n• 15 high-quality watercolor illustrations<br>\n• Transparent background<br>\n• High resolution<br>\n• 15 PNG files (transparent background)<br>\n• 15 SVG files</p>\n<p>🎃 Included illustrations:<br>\nPumpkin spice latte, hot apple cider, maple cinnamon latte, chai tea latte, salted caramel hot chocolate, honey lavender latte, orange spiced tea, cranberry mulled cider, vanilla bean cappuccino, toasted marshmallow mocha, pear &amp; cinnamon tea, pumpkin cream cold brew, brown sugar oat latte, blackberry herbal tea, gingerbread latte.</p>\n<p>🤎 Designed in a modern cozy watercolor style, these autumn drinks feature handcrafted mugs, elegant glassware, creamy foams, warm spices, and subtle seasonal accents without overwhelming details. Their soft organic shapes and inviting color palette make them perfect for autumn stickers, stationery, planners, mugs, kitchen décor, seasonal branding, and cozy fall-inspired creative projects.</p>",
